Hi <%= @partner.name %>

It's time to update your agency information!

Log in to your account at <%= new_user_session_url %> and open "My Profile"

If nothing has changed, choose 'Submit For Approval'.

If anything has changed:

- Click 'Update information'
- Change the information
- Click 'Save and review'
- Confirm that the information is correct
- Finally, click 'Submit For Approval'

For questions, contact <%= @organization.name %> at <%= @organization.email %>
